is named courts and marked plots and most importantly, it is ownership.<\/p><p>In the founder&#8217;s own spirit, that social and economic prosperity must exist in the same space, the land that once fed Nairobi will now anchor a secure, owned and thriving community.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e1ead62 elementor-align-right animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"e1ead62\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-float\" href=\"https:\/\/kirimarise.co.ke\/about\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" id=\"Layer_1\" viewBox=\"0 0 88.4 89.1\"><defs><style>      .st0 {        fill: #231f20;      }    <\/style><\/defs><polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"81.3 77.5 72.3 77.5 72.3 15.4 10.1 15.4 10.1 6.4 81.3 6.4 81.3 77.5\"><\/polygon><rect class=\"st0\" x=\"-3.7\" y=\"39.7\" width=\"94.3\" height=\"9\" transform=\"translate(-18.5 43.7) rotate(-45)\"><\/rect><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Learn More<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a4cf43 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1a4cf43\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-